{
  "id": "29394_kouteisuru",
  "headword": "{肯定|こうてい}する",
  "reading": "こうていする",
  "romaji": "kouteisuru",
  "part_of_speech": "suru verb",
  "gloss": "to affirm; to acknowledge as true",
  "definitions": [
    {
      "sense_number": 1,
      "gloss": "to affirm; to acknowledge as true",
      "explanation": "To affirm something as true or acceptable; to respond positively. The opposite of {否定|ひてい}する (to deny)."
    }
  ],
  "examples": [
    {
      "id": "29394_kouteisuru_ex1",
      "japanese": "{彼|かれ}の{意見|いけん}を{肯定|こうてい}する。",
      "english": "to affirm his opinion",
      "sense_numbers": [
        1
      ],
      "has_audio": false,
      "notes": null
    },
    {
      "id": "29394_kouteisuru_ex2",
      "japanese": "{自分|じぶん}の{過去|かこ}を{肯定|こうてい}できるようになった。",
      "english": "I've become able to accept my own past.",
      "sense_numbers": [
        1
      ],
      "has_audio": false,
      "notes": null
    },
    {
      "id": "29394_kouteisuru_ex3",
      "japanese": "{親|おや}は{子|こ}どもの{気持|きも}ちをまず{肯定|こうてい}してあげることが{大切|たいせつ}だ。",
      "english": "It is important for parents to first affirm their child's feelings.",
      "sense_numbers": [
        1
      ],
      "has_audio": false,
      "notes": null
    }
  ],
  "notes": "TRANSITIVITY: {他動詞|たどうし} (transitive). Pattern: X を {肯定|こうてい}する (affirm X).\n\nThe noun {肯定|こうてい} and the compound {自己|じこ}{肯定|こうてい}{感|かん} (\"sense of self-worth\") are common.\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {自己|じこ}{肯定|こうてい}{感|かん}: sense of self-worth\n- {現状|げんじょう}を{肯定|こうてい}する: to accept the status quo\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- {否定|ひてい}する: to deny, to negate",
